### ==========================================
### I. AUTHENTICATION & USER API
### ==========================================

### 1. Đăng ký User mẫu
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "U002",
  "username": "user02",
  "fullname": "Nguyen Van B",
  "password": "123456",
  "roleid": "R001",
  "mid": "M001"
}

### 2. Đăng nhập lấy Token
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user02",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 3. Xem Profile người dùng
GET http://localhost:3000/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1aWQiOiJVMDAyIiwidXNlcm5hbWUiOiJ1c2VyMDIiLCJyb2xlaWQiOiJSMDAxIiwiaWF0IjoxNzkyMjM5MjI4LCJleHAiOjE3OTIzMjU2Mjh9._kHqqxqSvJKfCzoCbISqQJeRVtWp3u9Za-7GZw_K0Fg


### ==========================================
### II. PRODUCT API (CRUD)
### ==========================================

### 1. Tạo sản phẩm mới (Khởi tạo P001 với tồn kho = 10)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pid": "P001",
  "pname": "Laptop",
  "price": 15000000,
  "quantity": 10
}

### 2. Lấy toàn bộ danh sách sản phẩm
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products

### 3. Lấy chi tiết sản phẩm P001 (Kiểm tra tồn kho hiện tại)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products/P001

### 4. Cập nhật thông tin sản phẩm P001
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/products/P001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pname": "Laptop Gaming",
  "price": 18000000,
  "quantity": 10
}

### 5. Xóa sản phẩm P001 (Dùng khi cần dọn dẹp data test)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/products/P001


### ==========================================
### III. ORDER API & TEST TRANSACTION (BƯỚC 13 & 14)
### ==========================================

### 1. Đặt hàng TH1: Mua hợp lệ (qty = 2 => Thành công, Tồn kho giảm từ 10 xuống 8)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1aWQiOiJVMDAyIiwidXNlcm5hbWUiOiJ1c2VyMDIiLCJyb2xlaWQiOiJSMDAxIiwiaWF0IjoxNzkyMjM5MjI4LCJleHAiOjE3OTIzMjU2Mjh9._kHqqxqSvJKfCzoCbISqQJeRVtWp3u9Za-7GZw_K0Fg

{
  "items": [
    {
      "pid": "P001",
      "qty": 2
    }
  ]
}

### 2. Đặt hàng TH2: Mua vượt tồn kho (qty = 100 => Thất bại, Báo lỗi 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1aWQiOiJVMDAyIiwidXNlcm5hbWUiOiJ1c2VyMDIiLCJyb2xlaWQiOiJSMDAxIiwiaWF0IjoxNzkyMjM5MjI4LCJleHAiOjE3OTIzMjU2Mjh9._kHqqxqSvJKfCzoCbISqQJeRVtWp3u9Za-7GZw_K0Fg

{
  "items": [
    {
      "pid": "P001",
      "qty": 100
    }
  ]
}

### 3. Xác nhận Rollback: Kiểm tra lại tồn kho P001 (Tồn kho giữ nguyên = 8)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products/P001

### 4. Xem danh sách đơn hàng đã tạo của User
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1aWQiOiJVMDAyIiwidXNlcm5hbWUiOiJ1c2VyMDIiLCJyb2xlaWQiOiJSMDAxIiwiaWF0IjoxNzkyMjM5MjI4LCJleHAiOjE3OTIzMjU2Mjh9._kHqqxqSvJKfCzoCbISqQJeRVtWp3u9Za-7GZw_K0Fg

### ==========================================
### IV. SHIPMENT API (TEST BƯỚC 15)
### ==========================================

### 1. Xem thông tin Shipment theo Order ID (oid lấy từ kết quả tạo đơn hàng)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/shipments/order/ORD_1792251072494
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1aWQiOiJVMDAyIiwidXNlcm5hbWUiOiJ1c2VyMDIiLCJyb2xlaWQiOiJSMDAxIiwiaWF0IjoxNzkyMjM5MjI4LCJleHAiOjE3OTIzMjU2Mjh9._kHqqxqSvJKfCzoCbISqQJeRVtWp3u9Za-7GZw_K0Fg

### 2. Cập nhật Shipment sang SHIPPING
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/shipments/SHIP_1792251072506/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1aWQiOiJVMDAyIiwidXNlcm5hbWUiOiJ1c2VyMDIiLCJyb2xlaWQiOiJSMDAxIiwiaWF0IjoxNzkyMjM5MjI4LCJleHAiOjE3OTIzMjU2Mjh9._kHqqxqSvJKfCzoCbISqQJeRVtWp3u9Za-7GZw_K0Fg

{
  "status": "SHIPPING"
}

### 3. Cập nhật Shipment sang DELIVERED
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/shipments/SHIP_1792251072506/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1aWQiOiJVMDAyIiwidXNlcm5hbWUiOiJ1c2VyMDIiLCJyb2xlaWQiOiJSMDAxIiwiaWF0IjoxNzkyMjM5MjI4LCJleHAiOjE3OTIzMjU2Mjh9._kHqqxqSvJKfCzoCbISqQJeRVtWp3u9Za-7GZw_K0Fg

{
  "status": "DELIVERED"
}